{"module":"/assets/explain/method/method-sum-product.js","part":"figure","scope":"method-sum-product","title":"交换检验后和积换元，用 s² ≥ 4p 消元","note":"例：实数 $x,y$ 满足 $x^2+y^2-xy=1$，求 $x+y$ 的范围。条件化为 $s^2-3p=1$，再与可行性条件 $s^2\\ge4p$ 联立。","after":"feasible","version":"8da53e64dab4","html":"<div class=\"method-figure\">\n      <div class=\"method-template\"><span class=\"method-node\"><small>交换</small><b><span class=\"nowrap\"><var>x</var> ↔ <var>y</var></span></b></span><span class=\"method-arrow\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\">→</i></span><span class=\"method-node\"><small>条件、目标</small><b>都不变</b></span><span class=\"method-arrow\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\">→</i></span><span class=\"method-node\"><small>和积换元</small><b class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><var>s</var> = <var>x</var> + <var>y</var>，</span><span class=\"nowrap\"><var>p</var> = <var>xy</var></span></b></span></div>\n      <p class=\"method-demo\"><span class=\"method-demo-tag\">例</span><span class=\"method-demo-body\"><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><span class=\"term plain\"><math><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></span><span class=\"op\">＋</span><span class=\"term plain\"><math><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>p</mi></math></span></span><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><span class=\"op\">⇒</span><math><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></math></span></span></p>\n      <p class=\"method-pill\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><var>s</var><sup>2</sup> ≥ 4<var>p</var></span> 来自 <span class=\"nowrap\">(<var>x</var> − <var>y</var>)<sup>2</sup> ≥ 0</span></p>\n    </div>"}
